Ran `crimes context src/petty.ts --format json` against the fixture. Four findings, all `low` severity — but the ranking is by **agent risk**, not severity, and that's the whole point of this file:

| # | Type | Charge | Symbol | agent_risk |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `return_shape_roulette` | Return Shape Roulette | `resolvePaymentResult` (L21–32) | 0.44 |
| 2 | `option_bag_junk_drawer` | Option Bag Junk Drawer | `describeCheckout` (L10–19) | 0.39 |
